title: "EasyPseudogene: pseudogene candidate discovery in Cross and Self modes"
type: software
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-13
authors:
  - name: "EasyPseudogene Development Team"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/chhhhai/EasyPseudogene"
abstract: "EasyPseudogene compares proteins with a target genome and reports pseudogene candidates, structural-disruption evidence, filtering decisions and reproducible run metadata. Outputs are computational candidates requiring biological review."
keywords:
  - pseudogene
  - comparative genomics
  - genome annotation
